<title>FRANCE: Carrefour buys additional GMB stake.</title>
<headline>Carrefour buys additional GMB stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>French retailer Carrefour said on Thursday it bought on December 17 an additional 8.1 percent stake in GMB.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase was on top of a December 10 acquisition of 33.34 percent of GMB, which controls the Cora Group, and brought its total holding in GMB to 41.4 percent.</p>
<p>The company said the total price paid for the 41.4 percent holding was 3.1 billion francs ($589.4 million).</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
<p>($ = 5.26 French Francs)</p>
